        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Jettison Cranium"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(incapacitation, mental, negative)\n\nThe cranium preserver ejects one of its preserved-head jars at a point within 100 feet. The jar explodes, and all creatures in a 10-foot burst must attempt a 28 Will save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature takes 2d8 mental damage and 2d8 negative damage.\n- **Failure:** The creature takes 4d8 mental damage and 4d8 negative damage. The discharged mental anguish released from the preserved head causes the creature to become confused for 1 round.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature takes 8d8 mental and 8d8 negative damage. The discharged mental anguish released from the preserved head causes the creature to become confused for 2 rounds."
            },
